---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Engineering | Bauhu" description="Engineering and resilience information for Bauhu building systems.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="bg-paper pt-32">
    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Engineering</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl leading-tight md:text-7xl">Designed for demanding coastal sites.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-7 text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">
          <p>Bauhu homes are designed around more than appearance. The building system, structure, shipping method, site handling and local completion route all need to work together.</p>
          <p>This matters most in remote, coastal and hurricane exposed locations, where conventional construction can become slow, uncertain and difficult to control.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-mist">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">System</p>
          <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Steel frame logic</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">A precise structural system gives each project a controlled manufactured core, reducing reliance on improvised site construction.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Climate</p>
          <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Coastal resilience</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">Homes must respond to wind, corrosion, heat, shade, maintenance and exposure from the earliest design stage.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-paper p-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Delivery</p>
          <h2 class="mt-12 font-display text-3xl">Remote logistics</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-ink/70">Design and manufacture are planned around packing, shipping, unloading, site access and local completion.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-ink text-paper">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-site">
        <p class="eyebrow text-stone">Why it matters</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-4xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">Beautiful homes still need a serious route to being built.</h2>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-paper/70">Bauhu’s value is the combination of architectural design and practical build system thinking. The aim is to create homes that are desirable to live in and realistic to deliver in locations where construction is rarely simple.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
